  "description": "\n Wyse Property Management are delighted to present this lovely bright and spacious first-floor apartment in The Maples, Orchard Square, set within a small development just off Bird Avenue, Clonskeagh.\n\nThe Orchard Square development comprises of two apartment buildings, surrounded by landscaped grounds, with the added benefits of  tennis court adjacent to the apartment, and ample parking for residents.\n\n\nThere is a great sense of space in this two-bedroom apartment, accommodation includes . entrance hall,  bright living/dining room with Patio Door to Balcony and window at other end on dining Area side. A separate kitchen  with counter space is well equipped. The bathroom with Velux window allows for natural light and fresh air. Additionally the 2 bedrooms with single beds and fitted wardrobes offer space for a desk and other furniture.\n\nLocality\n\nSituated within a short stroll of Clonskeagh Village, and minutes from Dundrum Town Centre and LUAS, this property also enjoys easy access to the M50 and the Business Parks of South Dublin. UCD Belfield is just a short stroll away and is served by a cycle lane.\n\n Viewings Highly recommended",
